rd by assuming that exposure was from initial receipt of OPV\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Based on this rate of nucleotide substitution, type 1 and type 3 isolates that are <1.0% divergent\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Candidate VDPVs identified by rRT-PCR screening are sequenced in the VP1 region for definitive analysis\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Count does not include 29 cases with <10 substitutions in VP1 detected before 2010.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}